WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.830
This is as close to a private
lesson with me as you can get.

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:06.758
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:10.662 --> 00:00:14.306
A good way to practice your
first serve and make it flat

00:00:14.306 --> 00:00:18.562
is to pronate more on the shot.

00:00:18.562 --> 00:00:21.020
Hey, John, I just
saw your backhand.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.185
Killer shot, good job, but
what I want you to try,

00:00:24.185 --> 00:00:26.005
I want you to try to
get your arm straight.

00:00:26.005 --> 00:00:28.240
Get your left arm
through it a little more.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.270
When I was getting
established as a player,

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:37.620
there were things that
I wished I'd learned.

